sentences.text:
Lastly, learned counsel for the petitioners submitted that the petitioners are in judicial custody;
co-accused persons namely Jitender (S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.12949/2024), Amit Bhati (S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.10430/2024), Sunil Purohit (S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.11376/2024) and Anirudh (S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.12950/2024)
have already been enlarged on bail by this Court vide order dated 07.11.2024; the investigation against the petitioners has already been concluded and the trial of the case will take sufficiently long time, therefore, the benefit of bail may be granted to the accused- petitioners.
